      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly heavy when financial math feels impossible to solve, but even a tiny adjustment in spending or a community loan program can sometimes shift the variables just enough to win. Your effort in trying to figure it out proves that one equation does have a solution, even if it requires finding help you haven't considered yet. Please reach out to a helpline at their website number or get helponeline.org; they provide free, confidential financial advice exactly for moments like these.",
